    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO THE LAND OF THE ANCIENT KING!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saddle up your Caravan Demon, lace up your coin purse and get ready to venture out into the world in <strong>Mini Merchant</strong>, the first release from Astrarium Games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the snowy peaks of Oareg Mountain, the Great Desert, the King\u2019s Meadows and untold more places as you fight monsters, explore dungeons, solve puzzles and most importantly, gather loot to sell to the highest bidder!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, sell, loot, uncover and unlock weapons, armor, items and cargo to become the richest and most powerful merchant in the land!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473760/extras/705902e1e2f710d0e15898850b3ca8a0.avif?t=1740646814\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A CLASSIC ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With artwork and gameplay inspired by the retro titles of the 1980s and 1990s, explore the world in any direction and with no constraints - it\u2019s up to you to figure out how you\u2019ll get rich.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore in any direction, discover the many secrets hidden in the world at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473760/extras/cf21db68b6c8443641588fe7303171ac.avif?t=1740646814\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEEP POCKETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 175 different items to find in the game, each with their own prices, weights and lore behind them. Can you find them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each market has its own preferred items, prices and quests to complete. Learn the secret routes between the markets to buy the cheapest and the rarest items, which items to sell in which locations and which to hold onto!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473760/extras/4b9ab7f290fabfa8ee45bf6dda5d3277.avif?t=1740646814\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE CARAVAN CHAMPION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best items are guarded by the most powerful enemies. Equip your character with the most powerful equipment, fight to defeat monsters and level up your character, so that you\u2019re strong enough to brave even the toughest dungeons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different equipment boosts and lowers different stats, so the best loadout is in the eye of the beholder\u2026 choose equipment that works for you best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473760/extras/ad512d18093e8aad7f918f4a3d5d2cff.avif?t=1740646814\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTO THE DARKNESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 30 different puzzle-filled dungeons to discover, 250 quests to complete, collectables to find, challenges to discover and monsters to slay, there\u2019s always something new to do!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dungeon is procedurally generated, so the challenge is different every time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473760/extras/7330792c2c8b6c6334b8f7623b71ba87.avif?t=1740646814\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAN YOU GET TO 100%?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 160 total achievements to unlock - can you get them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
